<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI工具与模型HOT</title><link>https://ai-tool-model-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>每天从 19 个信源（16 个 RSS + 3 个 Hugging Face 组织页）收 AI 模型发布与主流智能体更新，按规则打分精选，只显示标题、一句简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:13:06 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>Gemini 4 Neon 上线 GitHub Copilot</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-18-gemini-4-neon-in-github-copilot</link><description>谷歌新一代模型 Gemini 4 Neon 正式登陆 GitHub Copilot，主打智能体编程、多步工具调用与知识工作。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:49:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f6cf8ded0e75bec96e1b678b6b93caefa289f4d3</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-18-gemini-4-neon-in-github-copilot">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>OpenAI Agents SDK v0.24.0</title><link>https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.24.0</link><description>Agents SDK 发布 0.24.0 版，统一运行级函数错误格式并新增 MCP 发现标注，同时改进故障恢复、沙箱安全与链路追踪。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:20:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f6af3e2f5c3e509526f2682898852981da3684a7</guid><source url="https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.24.0">OpenAI Agents SDK Releases</source></item><item><title>Gemini 4 Neon 发布：前沿能力与执行速度兼顾的新成员</title><link>https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon</link><description>Gemini 4 家族的新成员，主打复杂编程、知识工作与科学任务的快速端到端完成，定位在 Carbon 与 Hydrogen 之间，兼顾前沿能力与成本效率，已在 Gemini API 与 AI Studio 上线。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:35:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b898a1b2127c5756e1c018cc6a81581a6294cda6</guid><source url="https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon">Google DeepMind Blog</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.328 发布</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-328</link><description>Claude Code 2.1.328 为 Opus 4.6 与 Sonnet 4.6 在 Bedrock、Google Cloud、Foundry 及应用网关上启用自动模式，免权限交互会话默认进入该模式。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:20:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">9d590322f684fa1fe551fc87f8b69c8f503722b7</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-328">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>LangSmith Tool Gateway：为智能体提供安全、受治理的工具调用</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-tool-gateway</link><description>LangSmith 推出工具网关公开测试版，统一管理智能体每次工具调用的凭证、身份与权限，支持策略、审批与全链路追踪。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:00:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">48de2ffa10d67e095529c39e42490addedbe8189</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-tool-gateway">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>OpenAI 发布 GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol</title><link>https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-6-2-astra-sol</link><description>GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol 在专业输出、编程、电脑操作与成本效率上都有提升，已覆盖 ChatGPT Work、Codex 与 API。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:45:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">549a77347d5e1e5f25e081258d641a2b8758c868</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-6-2-astra-sol">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>Genie 4 现已上线</title><link>https://deepmind.google/blog/genie-4-is-now-available</link><description>DeepMind 的交互式世界模型 Genie 4 正式开放，可由文字或图像提示生成能够实时探索的互动世界。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:13:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">50e3ea47cbae988d3477f301b521889b55c9580b</guid><source url="https://deepmind.google/blog/genie-4-is-now-available">Google DeepMind Blog</source></item><item><title>DaisyRose-27B：推进后训练效率的前沿</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/RadixArk/daisyrose-27b-pushing-the-frontier-of-post-trainin</link><description>RadixArk 发布 27B 参数模型 DaisyRose，探索用更少的后训练投入换取更强的模型表现。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:54:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f689168723dc030df68e3b673ab44c5f35046795</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/RadixArk/daisyrose-27b-pushing-the-frontier-of-post-trainin">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>发布数据标注队列</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/announcing-data-annotation-queue</link><description>用 LangSmith 的数据标注队列审阅日志、标注数据并沉淀数据集，让大模型应用从原型稳步走向生产。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:33:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">335c172adf129f6320dd27d101537fc81f313af7</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/announcing-data-annotation-queue">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol 接入 GitHub Copilot</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-openais-gpt-6-2-astra-and-gpt-6-2-sol-now-available</link><description>OpenAI 的 GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol 已在 GitHub Copilot 全面可用，面向智能体编程与代码评审做了强化。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:20:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">96ff71f54c6e7b4da47668acaa4a513b0085cd1a</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-openais-gpt-6-2-astra-and-gpt-6-2-sol-now-available">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.327 发布</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-327</link><description>Claude Code 2.1.327 在安装 GitHub 应用改动仓库前先征求确认，并让 MCP 服务器配置可从标准输入读取 JSON。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:22:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2b7a7366c72677641c0dd7f4007e9797114b8bbe</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-327">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code v0.28.1 预览版</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.1-preview.0</link><description>Qwen Code 的预览更新，验证了托管智能体的定时任务触发，并加固了状态检查与容器配置。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:56:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">564aa296ded401b85b17beac2a3926158ef632e6</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.1-preview.0">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code 每夜构建 v0.28.0-nightly.20261118</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.0-nightly.20261118.d9ac287c9f</link><description>Qwen Code 发布新一期每夜构建，改进托管智能体的定时循环测试，并加固 PR 校验的状态守卫与容器逻辑。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:29:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2cde799921c8c7805802a15d870fa67af71a9275</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.0-nightly.20261118.d9ac287c9f">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.71.0 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.71.0</link><description>Pydantic AI 2.71.0 版上线，改动集中在多智能体对等网络的连接方式与接口命名，并接入新的模型服务商 Stav。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 02:13:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">77770fa210de2552a66026b4560552e3450b3250</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.71.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item><item><title>Devin 推出 Devin Bots</title><link>https://devin.ai/blog/introducing-devin-bots</link><description>Devin Bots 是能为目标负责的工程队友，会带领一队 Devin 去交付成果，而不只是接单做任务。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">053a7a9d8ca5a8c12607b3d6e73dfbed9fd20802</guid><source url="https://devin.ai/blog/introducing-devin-bots">Devin Blog</source></item><item><title>OpenAI Agents SDK v0.25.0</title><link>https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.25.0</link><description>Agents SDK 发布 0.25.0，开放了第三方会话适配器的工具方法，移除了 Runloop 沙箱提供方，并加入了可开关的交接错误恢复。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:38:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">c4677f385445c7757e4900f265f1ce7a26aef411</guid><source url="https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.25.0">OpenAI Agents SDK Releases</source></item><item><title>Rumble-2-Flash：覆盖 40 多种语言的开源 0.5B 语音模型</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/rumble-2-flash</link><description>一个仅 0.5B 参数的开源语音模型，支持 40 多种语言，适合在资源有限的设备上做语音处理。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">679cee5ea1466f1fcddadc93ba91d96b658d38dc</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/rumble-2-flash">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>Gemini 应用现已支持低内存安卓设备</title><link>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/products/gemini-app/gemini-lower-memory-devices</link><description>Gemini 应用放宽了安卓设备的内存门槛，低内存手机也能用上 Gemini Live 和自定义图片生成功能。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">8e6075d168e06821304f71b020ff8006369d63dc</guid><source url="https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/products/gemini-app/gemini-lower-memory-devices">Google AI Blog</source></item><item><title>为你的团队定制 GitHub Copilot</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-18-customize-github-copilot-for-your-team</link><description>团队定制功能正式面向组织团队开放，成员无需各自重复配置，即可共享团队常用的 Copilot 插件。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:00:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f9b17ed5db16e28ce5120e656f075832e401a446</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-18-customize-github-copilot-for-your-team">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>用 LangSmith Alerts 提前发现生产故障</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-alerts</link><description>为错误率、运行延迟和反馈评分设置实时通知，在用户察觉之前发现生产问题。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:33:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">48b8cce7f5510ef85847db4f873e5f79cb5532a1</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-alerts">LangChain Blog</source></item></channel></rss>
